 **Parameters:**
-*   **QEF Error Threshold:** A user-specified value controlling the level of simplification. Higher thresholds allow more aggressive simplification [S1, unofficial]. In viewer-dependent applications, this threshold is adjusted per octree cell based on viewer distance (higher for distant cells) [S1, unofficial].
